[
  {
    "content_id": "10061001001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得后书 1:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "61001001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;作耶稣基督仆人和使徒的西门·彼得写信给那因我们的　神和救主耶稣基督之义、与我们同得一样宝贵信心的人。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10061001002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得后书 1:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "61001002",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;愿恩惠、平安，因你们认识　神和我们主耶稣，多多地加给你们。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10061001003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得后书 1:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "61001003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;神的神能已将一切关乎生命和虔敬的事赐给我们，皆因我们认识那用自己荣耀和美德召我们的主。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10061001004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得后书 1:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "61001004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;因此，他已将又宝贵又极大的应许赐给我们，叫我们既脱离世上从情欲来的败坏，就得与　神的性情有分。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10061001005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得后书 1:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "61001005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;正因这缘故，你们要分外地殷勤；有了信心，又要加上德行；有了德行，又要加上知识；</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10061001006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得后书 1:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "61001006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;有了知识，又要加上节制；有了节制，又要加上忍耐；有了忍耐，又要加上虔敬；</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10061001007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得后书 1:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "61001007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;有了虔敬，又要加上爱弟兄的心；有了爱弟兄的心，又要加上爱众人的心。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10061001008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得后书 1:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "61001008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;你们若充充足足地有这几样，就必使你们在认识我们的主耶稣基督上不至于闲懒不结果子了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10061001009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得后书 1:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "61001009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;人若没有这几样，就是眼瞎，只看见近处的，忘了他旧日的罪已经得了洁净。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10061001010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得后书 1:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "61001010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;所以弟兄们，应当更加殷勤，使你们所蒙的恩召和拣选坚定不移。你们若行这几样，就永不失脚；</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10061001011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得后书 1:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "61001011",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;这样，必叫你们丰丰富富地得以进入我们主—救主耶稣基督永远的国。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10061001012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得后书 1:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "61001012",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;你们虽然晓得这些事，并且在你们已有的真道上坚固，我却要将这些事常常提醒你们。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10061001013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得后书 1:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "61001013",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;我以为应当趁我还在这帐棚的时候提醒你们，激发你们；</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10061001014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得后书 1:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "61001014",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;因为知道我脱离这帐棚的时候快到了，正如我们主耶稣基督所指示我的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10061001015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得后书 1:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "61001015",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;并且，我要尽心竭力，使你们在我去世以后时常记念这些事。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10061001016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得后书 1:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "61001016",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;我们从前将我们主耶稣基督的大能和他降临的事告诉你们，并不是随从乖巧捏造的虚言，乃是亲眼见过他的威荣。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10061001017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得后书 1:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "61001017",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;他从父　神得尊贵荣耀的时候，从极大荣光之中有声音出来，向他说：「这是我的爱子，我所喜悦的。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10061001018",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得后书 1:18",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "61001018",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>18</sup>&nbsp;我们同他在圣山的时候，亲自听见这声音从天上出来。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10061001019",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得后书 1:19",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "61001019",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>19</sup>&nbsp;我们并有先知更确的预言，如同灯照在暗处。你们在这预言上留意，直等到天发亮，晨星在你们心里出现的时候，才是好的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10061001020",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得后书 1:20",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "61001020",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>20</sup>&nbsp;第一要紧的，该知道经上所有的预言没有可随私意解说的；</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10061001021",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得后书 1:21",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "61001021",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>21</sup>&nbsp;因为预言从来没有出于人意的，乃是人被圣灵感动，说出　神的话来。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10061002001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得后书 2:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "61002001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;从前在百姓中有假先知起来，将来在你们中间也必有假师傅，私自引进陷害人的异端，连买他们的主他们也不承认，自取速速地灭亡。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10061002002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得后书 2:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "61002002",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;将有许多人随从他们邪淫的行为，便叫真道因他们的缘故被毁谤。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10061002003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得后书 2:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "61002003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;他们因有贪心，要用捏造的言语在你们身上取利。他们的刑罚，自古以来并不迟延；他们的灭亡也必速速来到。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10061002004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得后书 2:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "61002004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;就是天使犯了罪，　神也没有宽容，曾把他们丢在地狱，交在黑暗坑中，等候审判。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10061002005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得后书 2:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "61002005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;神也没有宽容上古的世代，曾叫洪水临到那不敬虔的世代，却保护了传义道的挪亚一家八口。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10061002006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得后书 2:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "61002006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;又判定所多玛、蛾摩拉，将二城倾覆，焚烧成灰，作为后世不敬虔人的鉴戒；</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10061002007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得后书 2:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "61002007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;只搭救了那常为恶人淫行忧伤的义人罗得。（</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10061002008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得后书 2:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "61002008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;因为那义人住在他们中间，看见听见他们不法的事，他的义心就天天伤痛。）</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10061002009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得后书 2:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "61002009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;主知道搭救敬虔的人脱离试探，把不义的人留在刑罚之下，等候审判的日子。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10061002010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得后书 2:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "61002010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;那些随肉身、纵污秽的情欲、轻慢主治之人的，更是如此。 他们胆大任性，毁谤在尊位的，也不知惧怕。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10061002011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得后书 2:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "61002011",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;就是天使，虽然力量权能更大，还不用毁谤的话在主面前告他们。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10061002012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得后书 2:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "61002012",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;但这些人好像没有灵性，生来就是畜类，以备捉拿宰杀的。他们毁谤所不晓得的事，正在败坏人的时候，自己必遭遇败坏。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10061002013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得后书 2:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "61002013",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;行的不义，就得了不义的工价。这些人喜爱白昼宴乐，他们已被玷污，又有瑕疵，正与你们一同坐席，就以自己的诡诈为快乐。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10061002014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得后书 2:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "61002014",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;他们满眼是淫色，止不住犯罪，引诱那心不坚固的人，心中习惯了贪婪，正是被咒诅的种类。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10061002015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得后书 2:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "61002015",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;他们离弃正路，就走差了，随从比珥之子巴兰的路。巴兰就是那贪爱不义之工价的先知，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10061002016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得后书 2:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "61002016",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;他却为自己的过犯受了责备；那不能说话的驴以人言拦阻先知的狂妄。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10061002017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得后书 2:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "61002017",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;这些人是无水的井，是狂风催逼的雾气，有墨黑的幽暗为他们存留。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10061002018",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得后书 2:18",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "61002018",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>18</sup>&nbsp;他们说虚妄矜夸的大话，用肉身的情欲和邪淫的事引诱那些刚才脱离妄行的人。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10061002019",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得后书 2:19",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "61002019",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>19</sup>&nbsp;他们应许人得以自由，自己却作败坏的奴仆，因为人被谁制伏就是谁的奴仆。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10061002020",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得后书 2:20",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "61002020",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>20</sup>&nbsp;倘若他们因认识主—救主耶稣基督，得以脱离世上的污秽，后来又在其中被缠住、制伏，他们末后的景况就比先前更不好了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10061002021",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得后书 2:21",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "61002021",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>21</sup>&nbsp;他们晓得义路，竟背弃了传给他们的圣命，倒不如不晓得为妙。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10061002022",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得后书 2:22",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "61002022",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>22</sup>&nbsp;俗语说得真不错： 狗所吐的，它转过来又吃； 猪洗净了又回到泥里去滚； 这话在他们身上正合式。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10061003001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得后书 3:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "61003001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;亲爱的弟兄啊，我现在写给你们的是第二封信。这两封都是提醒你们，激发你们诚实的心，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10061003002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得后书 3:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "61003002",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;叫你们记念圣先知预先所说的话和主救主的命令，就是使徒所传给你们的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10061003003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得后书 3:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "61003003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;第一要紧的，该知道在末世必有好讥诮的人随从自己的私欲出来讥诮说：</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10061003004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得后书 3:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "61003004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;「主要降临的应许在哪里呢？因为从列祖睡了以来，万物与起初创造的时候仍是一样。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10061003005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得后书 3:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "61003005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;他们故意忘记，从太古，凭　神的命有了天，并从水而出、借水而成的地。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10061003006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得后书 3:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "61003006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;故此，当时的世界被水淹没就消灭了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10061003007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得后书 3:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "61003007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;但现在的天地还是凭着那命存留，直留到不敬虔之人受审判遭沉沦的日子，用火焚烧。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10061003008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得后书 3:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "61003008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;亲爱的弟兄啊，有一件事你们不可忘记，就是主看一日如千年，千年如一日。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10061003009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得后书 3:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "61003009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;主所应许的尚未成就，有人以为他是耽延，其实不是耽延，乃是宽容你们，不愿有一人沉沦，乃愿人人都悔改。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10061003010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得后书 3:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "61003010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;但主的日子要像贼来到一样。那日，天必大有响声废去，有形质的都要被烈火销化，地和其上的物都要烧尽了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10061003011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得后书 3:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "61003011",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;这一切既然都要如此销化，你们为人该当怎样圣洁，怎样敬虔，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10061003012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得后书 3:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "61003012",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;切切仰望　神的日子来到。在那日，天被火烧就销化了，有形质的都要被烈火熔化。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10061003013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得后书 3:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "61003013",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;但我们照他的应许，盼望新天新地，有义居在其中。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10061003014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得后书 3:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "61003014",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;亲爱的弟兄啊，你们既盼望这些事，就当殷勤，使自己没有玷污，无可指摘，安然见主；</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10061003015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得后书 3:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "61003015",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;并且要以我主长久忍耐为得救的因由，就如我们所亲爱的兄弟保罗，照着所赐给他的智慧写了信给你们。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10061003016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得后书 3:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "61003016",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;他一切的信上也都是讲论这事。信中有些难明白的，那无学问、不坚固的人强解，如强解别的经书一样，就自取沉沦。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10061003017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得后书 3:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "61003017",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;亲爱的弟兄啊，你们既然预先知道这事，就当防备，恐怕被恶人的错谬诱惑，就从自己坚固的地步上坠落。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10061003018",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "彼得后书 3:18",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "61003018",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>18</sup>&nbsp;你们却要在我们主—救主耶稣基督的恩典和知识上有长进。愿荣耀归给他，从今直到永远。阿们！</p>"
  }
]